(THG-25, THG-34: every declaration form gives every field its declared
 default (LANGUAGE.md:1019-1020); `Create` does too (LANGUAGE.md:1041).
 A fresh thing gets 1-3 fields of random kind (number/float/boolean),
 each with a random declared default; the declaration form - bare,
 `Create`, or `Set a T called N to <a whole T>` from an already-declared
 source of the same type - is drawn at random and the resulting
 instance's fields are asserted against their declared defaults. Over a
 campaign this puts all three forms on trial; any one draw exercises
 `Create` about a third of the time, which is THG-34's row.)

To 'gen leaf thing declaration forms' with a text called indent and a boolean called nested.
    a text called 'the type phrase' is 'gen things a fresh type'.
    a text called 'the type' is 'gen written name' of 'the type phrase'.
    a number called 'the field count draw' is 'rng below' of 3.
    a number called 'how many fields' is 'the field count draw' add 1.
    a list called 'the field names' is [].
    a list called 'the field keywords' is [].
    a list called 'the field defaults' is [].
    a number called 'the field made' is 0.
    While 'the field made' is less than 'how many fields',
        a text called 'the field phrase' is 'gen things a fresh field',
        a text called 'the field name' is 'gen written name' of 'the field phrase',
        a number called 'the kind draw' is 'rng below' of 3,
        a text called 'the field keyword' is "number",
        a text called 'the field default' is "",
        If 'the kind draw' is 0 then,
            Set 'the field default' to 'literal integer'.
        If 'the kind draw' is 1 then,
            Set 'the field keyword' to "float",
            Set 'the field default' to 'gen extreme float'.
        If 'the kind draw' is 2 then,
            Set 'the field keyword' to "boolean",
            a number called 'the boolean draw' is 'gen things a boolean draw',
            Set 'the field default' to 'gen things a boolean literal' of 'the boolean draw'.
        append 'the field name' to 'the field names',
        append 'the field keyword' to 'the field keywords',
        append 'the field default' to 'the field defaults',
        Set 'the field made' to 'the field made' add 1.
    'gen emit' of "A thing called {'the type'} has\n".
    a number called 'the position' is 1.
    While 'the position' is less than or equal to 'how many fields',
        a text called 'the built name' is element 'the position' of 'the field names',
        a text called 'the built keyword' is element 'the position' of 'the field keywords',
        a text called 'the built default' is element 'the position' of 'the field defaults',
        a text called 'the ending' is ",",
        If 'the position' is 'how many fields' then,
            Set 'the ending' to ".".
        'gen emit' of "    a {'the built keyword'} called {'the built name'} is {'the built default'}{'the ending'}\n",
        Set 'the position' to 'the position' add 1.
    'gen emit' of "\n".
    a number called 'the form draw' is 'rng below' of 3.
    a list called 'the lines' is [].
