    a number called 'the magnitude' is 'rng below' of 1000.
    a number called 'the original value' is 'the magnitude'.
    If 'the sign draw' is 0 then,
        Set 'the original value' to 0 subtract 'the magnitude'.
    a number called 'the delta' is 'rng below' of 50 add 1.
    a number called 'the mutated value' is 'the original value' add 'the delta'.
    'gen emit' of "A thing called {'the type'} has\n".
    'gen emit' of "    a number called {'the field'} is {'the original value'}.\n\n".
    a text called 'the function phrase' is 'gen things a fresh function'.
    a text called 'the function' is 'gen written name' of 'the function phrase'.
    a text called 'the parameter phrase' is 'gen fresh parameter phrase'.
    a text called 'the parameter' is 'gen written name' of 'the parameter phrase'.
    a text called 'the parameter possessive' is 'gen possessive name' of 'the parameter phrase'.
    a text called 'the introducer' is 'gen parameter introducer'.
    'gen emit' of "To {'the function'} {'the introducer'} a {'the type'} called {'the parameter'}.\n".
    'gen emit' of "    Set {'the parameter possessive'} {'the field'} to {'the parameter possessive'} {'the field'} add {'the delta'}.\n".
    'gen emit' of "    Return a {'the type'}, {'the parameter'}.\n\n".
    Set gen_instances to gen_instances add 1.
    a number called 'the caller instance number' is gen_instances.
    a text called 'the caller decl' is "a {'the type'} called i{'the caller instance number'}".
    a text called 'the preposition' is 'gen call preposition'.
    Set gen_instances to gen_instances add 1.
    a number called 'the result instance number' is gen_instances.
    a text called 'the result decl' is "a {'the type'} called i{'the result instance number'} is {'the function'} {'the preposition'} i{'the caller instance number'}".
    a text called 'the caller subject' is "i{'the caller instance number'}'s {'the field'}".
    a text called 'the result subject' is "i{'the result instance number'}'s {'the field'}".
    a text called 'the original shown' is "{'the original value'}".
    a text called 'the mutated shown' is "{'the mutated value'}".
    a text called 'the caller assert' is 'gen assert number' of "THG-58" and 'the caller subject' and 'the original shown' and 'the original shown'.
    a text called 'the result assert' is 'gen assert number' of "THG-58" and 'the result subject' and 'the mutated shown' and 'the mutated shown'.
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the caller decl', 'the result decl', 'the caller assert', 'the result assert'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

