    a number called 'the expected' is 'the field value' multiply 'the factor value'.
    a text called 'the set line' is "Set {'the instance name'}'s {'the field'} to {'the literal'}".
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the instance declaration', 'the set line'].
    a number called 'the rotation' is 'rng below' of 4.
    a number called 'the step' is 0.
    While 'the step' is less than 4,
        a number called 'the raw slot' is 'the step' add 'the rotation',
        a number called 'the slot' is 'the raw slot' modulo 4,
        a number called 'the position' is 'the slot' add 1,
        a text called 'the preposition' is element 'the position' of gen_thing_call_prepositions,
        Set gen_args to gen_args add 1,
        a text called 'the result' is "c{gen_args}",
        a text called 'the call decl' is "a number called {'the result'} is {gen_thing_function_scaling_written} {'the preposition'} {'the instance name'} and {'the factor'}",
        append 'the call decl' to 'the lines',
        a text called 'the call assert' is 'gen assert number is' of "THG2-27" and 'the result' and 'the expected',
        append 'the call assert' to 'the lines',
        Set 'the step' to 'the step' add 1.
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

